  unitName: Fire Totem
  unitId: 10133
  unitNumber: 189
  description: Created by the gods, it embodies the power of fire. Ancient scripts
    say it appears with a column of fire and burns until all around it is ash. Reaching
    to the heavens, it is feared and worshipped as a messenger of the gods by tribes
    who believe it to have existed before the world was destroyed. Legend says that
    those who the gods deem worthy may receive their power.
  summonDesc: I am a Fire Totem.<br>I trust you'll make proper use<br>of this power
    I grant you.
